DESCRIPTION:Break in through the front door that we fitted lock\, pushbar\,
  inter locking etc.  HOW?  FItted the missing shim that Simon mentioned.  W
 ho has it Roman or Daniil?  Do not want to put ina  latch receiver.   Sound
 s like it has to be a solid rectangle piece.   When at site call me.\nI am 
 reaching out regardinga recent break-in at the building\, which occurred at
  the front entrance in thesame manner as the January 3 incident.\n\nAs you 
 are aware\, reinforcement work was completed on this door following theprev
 ious occurrence. However\, based on the current damage and method of entry\
 ,it appears the door was able to be bypassed again in a similar way despite
 those upgrades.\n\nMy understanding is that an interlocking blocker plate w
 as installed as part ofthat scope. If so\, it does not appear to have preve
 nted the door from beingpried open. I would appreciate your assessment of h
 ow this occurred and why theexisting measures did not perform as intended.\
 n\nAdditionally\, there is now damage to the door which is affecting its ab
 ility tolatch consistently when closed. This is an immediate security conce
 rn. Couldyou please dispatch a technician to attend site as soon as possibl
 e to reviewand advise on repairs? Photos have been included for reference.\
 n\nGiven the recurrence of this issue following the recent upgrades\, the B
 oard islooking for a clear understanding of what occurred and what can be d
 one toensure this entrance is properly secured moving forward.
LAST-MODIFIED:20260520T234756Z
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Rocky ridge Landing
