DESCRIPTION:<p>The RBH Integra32 software can be accessed with user name "r
 bh" and password "password". The Provision CCTVNVR (192.168.16.200) can be 
 accessed with user "admin" and password"123456". I reset the password for t
 he "Copperfield" user to "Winter2026!" on the second floor PC and gave the 
 user admin rights. If there is a separate Hikvision NVR installed somewhere
 \, I don't have any access to it and most likely it wasn't installed by us.
  The front door intercom panels would be programmed directly and you can tr
 y the password"1999" for access.  Intercom 9999 then 0192 to access\, </p><
 p>With the login for the buildings network video recorder (NVR) I can know 
 test to confirm if that can be added as is to the new recording software or
  requires replacement.</p><p>The Garbage NVR we will need to get the passwo
 rd and can do that through Hikvision for you\, no worries.</p><p>For the in
 tercoms\; we can test that code for you to ensure it is correct. Who has be
 en adding entries to the intercom for residents until now? Whomever that is
 \, would absolutely know the code since it is required for programming. If 
 not PCS\, please ask that person as well?</p><p>When onsite we will confirm
  the logins for the PC\, RBH\, and Camera as well.</p>
