DESCRIPTION:The Board has ordered the replacement Recorder\, Server\, and V
 ideo Management software with configuration. There are 3 different brands o
 f cameras from multiple “generations” of installation.<br>Currently there a
 re:<br>3 x Original Wide-Angle Cameras - 2 within the elevator and 1 within
  the Parkade Elevator Lobby<br>6 x Original 3MP Cameras<br>3 x Older 3MP (2
 nd Generation)<br>3 x Newer 4MP (Most recent)<br>No need to change out the 
 3 newer cameras. Change the 6 Original cameras and 3 Wide Angles. The 3 Old
 er 3MP cameras have to be repalced.<br>6 new additional cameras identified 
 with Yoshimi during a walkthrough.<br><br>1.<br>Exterior Main Entrance Inst
 all one camera at the exterior of the main entrance\, positioned to capture
  the intercom and exterior main entrance\, stairs\, and a portion of the dr
 iveway approaching the entrance<br>2.<br>Interior Main Lobby Install one ca
 mera inside the main entrance lobby at the mailbox bench\, positioned to ca
 pture the mailbox area and a view back toward the main entrance interior do
 ors<br>3.<br>T2 South Storage Locker Area Install one camera in the South T
 2 Storage Locker area with coverage of Entry through the access-controlled 
 door to the storage locker door\, Movement through to Stairwell door\, and 
 Corridor movement<br>4.<br>T2 South Storage Locker Area add one camera in t
 he T2 North elevator lobby positioned to View the secondary door leading in
 to the T2 storage area\, door into the garbage<br>5.<br>T1 East Hallway – S
 torage Room Entrance add one camera in this area to monitor the storage roo
 m entrance and hallway traffic to North T1 Exit<br>6.<br>T1 West Storage Ro
 om Entrance Area add one camera in this area to view entry from the hallway
 \, entry to the parkade\, and entry into the storage room. <br>Note: There 
 is a camera in the T1 Hallway viewing the door near the elevators\, and ano
 ther camera within the T1 parking area – these two cameras may suffice in p
 roviding review of people entering the area with the storage lobby and this
  camera could be utilized elsewhere<br><br>We also discussed the need for c
 orrect coverage within the Parkade Level:<br>Specifically\, adding four new
  cameras and relocating 3 of the existing positions to greatly improve cove
 rage of the whole parkade level.<br><br>9 x 4 Megapixel Indoor/Outdoor IR D
 ome/Turret Style Camera<br>9 x Wall or Conduit Mounts\, as needed<br>1 x 9-
 Port PoE Switch with Gigabit Links<br>2 x Recorder Camera Device License wi
 th Lifetime Updates\, 4 Pack<br><br>There are currently Sixteen old 2-door 
 controllers and one old 4-door controller.<br>28 x Smart Ready Prox Reader 
 without Keypad\, replacement<br>1 x Smart Ready Prox Reader with Keypad gar
 bage room<br>Also<br>Replacement Installation and configuration <br>2 Eleva
 tor Wide Angle Cameras<br>2 Elevator Adapters<br>TKelevator- you can contac
 t:<p>Moseley\,Derek &lt\;<a href="mailto:derek.moseley@tkelevator.com" targ
 et="_blank">derek.moseley@tkelevator.com</a>  403-371-7315.  Be sure totell
  them this is for 14635 Shawnee Gate SW </p>
