 ever 12 mm sounds like a lot.   That means the door is very loose.   Clarif
 y that with Simon please.\n\nHowever\, there is some play between the compo
 nents. To correct this\, a 12 mm spacer should be installed beneath the box
  that houses the electrical strike.    Check if that is 12mm thick spacer\n
