DESCRIPTION:<p>The RBH Integra32 software can be accessed with user name &q
 uot\;rbh&quot\; and password &quot\;password&quot\;. The Provision CCTVNVR 
 (192.168.16.200) can be accessed with user &quot\;admin&quot\; and password
 &quot\;123456&quot\;. I reset the password for the &quot\;Copperfield&quot\
 ; user to &quot\;Winter2026!&quot\; on the second floor PC and gave the use
 r admin rights. If there is a separate Hikvision NVR installed somewhere\, 
 I don&#39\;t have any access to it and most likely it wasn&#39\;t installed
  by us. The front door intercom panels would be programmed directly and you
  can try the password&quot\;1999&quot\; for access.  Intercom 9999 then 019
 2 to access\, </p><p>With the login for the buildings network video recorde
 r (NVR) I can know test to confirm if that can be added as is to the new re
 cording software or requires replacement.</p><p>The Garbage NVR we will nee
 d to get the password and can do that through Hikvision for you\, no worrie
 s.</p><p>For the intercoms\; we can test that code for you to ensure it is 
 correct. Who has been adding entries to the intercom for residents until no
 w? Whomever that is\, would absolutely know the code since it is required f
 or programming. If not PCS\, please ask that person as well?</p><p>When ons
 ite we will confirm the logins for the PC\, RBH\, and Camera as well.</p>
